                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game is a cute and casual tower defense. Even if you think you are bad at tower defenses, do not worry. This one is an easy gate into the genre. And even if you are a hardcore tower defense player, I would still recommend this game as a restful change of pace and a breath of fresh air.\nThe game has an original idea.\nThe game consists of two parts and a combination of defense and escape.\nEverything is done at a good level.\nIn the graphic style, everything is fine.\nTime in this game flies imperceptibly.\nNot much do I have to complain about, and though I am sure other pros and cons exist, I can't think of them off the top of my head.",
